{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103492","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103492","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710349201:1":{"text":"宮廷魔法院の古い記録で見たことがあります。これは紅碧（べにあおい）の障壁です。","source_cn":"殿下，我在魔法事务司的旧档案里见过这个。这是红蓝屏障。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x856D2446AF0F1BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710349202:1":{"text":"メイジがよく使う防御魔法の一種で、重要な物資や書類を保管した区域を封鎖するために用いられます。","source_cn":"这是魔法师常用的一种通用防御魔法，通常用来封锁存放重要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB243871C76CD5215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710349203:0":{"text":"どうしてそれが古聖堂に使われているのよ？","source_cn":"那为什么会突然出现在圣古堂里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F81902CCDD96BCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710349204:1":{"text":"おそらく、入口を封鎖している奇妙な魔力の波動が原因で、休眠していたバリアが再稼働したのではないでしょうか？","source_cn":"恐怕是因为刚才那个切断出口的异常魔力波动，使得这些原本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3442B71BB7818B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710349205:1":{"text":"本当にツイてないわね……じゃあ、どうやって解除すればいいの？記録を読んだのなら、解除法も知ってるはずよね？","source_cn":"真是倒霉……那这个要怎么解开？既然你读过档案，应该知道...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13EFAC18F99487D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710349206:1":{"text":"はい。このタイプの封印には、同色共鳴の法則が使われています。","source_cn":"是的，这种封印的原理基于同色共鸣法则。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x434DD6DE28DA3F92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710349207:1":{"text":"左の扉のそばに、クリスタルの付いているレバーがあります。そこに魔力を注いで青いクリスタルを活性化させれば、青いバリアが中和されます。赤いバリアも同じ原理ですよ。","source_cn":"左侧的门旁有同色晶石机关，只要注入魔力激活蓝色晶石机关...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA7729D340D1444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710349208:0":{"text":"それじゃあ、奥へ行くには、まずこの邪魔な青いバリアを消さないといけないわね。","source_cn":"那既然我们要往深处走，就得先把挡路的这个蓝色屏障解决掉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFCA0DE1392BD40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710349209:1":{"text":"魔力を注げばいいの？私にやらせて！","source_cn":"注入魔力吗？我去试试看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED34F17AF2195A32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:科丝蒂":{"text":"カスティー","source":"科丝蒂","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"ペギー","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}